#. Description of the plugin
#: echo-staging-seal.php
msgid "Seals a staging copy: every email, SMS, webhook, payment and analytics call is caught by Rhythm Echo instead of reaching real people. Shows what was stopped per plugin. Snapshots and compares what the site sends around updates."
msgstr ""

